#TPC-H/TPC-R Minimum Cost Supplier Query (Q2)
explain format=tree select
s_acctbal,
s_name,
n_name,
p_partkey,
p_mfgr,
s_address,
s_phone,
s_comment
from
part,
supplier,
partsupp,
nation,
region
where
p_partkey = ps_partkey
and s_suppkey = ps_suppkey
and p_size = 32
and p_type like '%NICKEL'
	and s_nationkey = n_nationkey
and n_regionkey = r_regionkey
and r_name = 'AMERICA'
	and ps_supplycost = (
select
min(ps_supplycost)
from
partsupp,
supplier,
nation,
region
where
p_partkey = ps_partkey
and s_suppkey = ps_suppkey
and s_nationkey = n_nationkey
and n_regionkey = r_regionkey
and r_name = 'AMERICA'
	)
order by
s_acctbal desc,
n_name,
s_name,
p_partkey
LIMIT 100;
EXPLAIN
-> Limit: 100 row(s)
    -> Sort: supplier.s_acctbal DESC, nation.n_name, supplier.s_name, part.p_partkey, limit input to 100 row(s) per chunk
        -> Stream results  (cost=*** rows=***)
            -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                    -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Inner hash join (no condition)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Filter: ((part.p_size = 32) and (part.p_type like '%NICKEL'))  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                -> Table scan on part  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Hash
                                -> Filter: (region.r_name = 'AMERICA')  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                    -> Table scan on region  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Filter: (partsupp.ps_supplycost = (select #2))  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Index lookup on partsupp using PRIMARY (ps_partkey=part.p_partkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Select #2 (subquery in condition; dependent)
                                -> Aggregate: min(partsupp.ps_supplycost)
                                    -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                        -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                            -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                                -> Filter: (region.r_name = 'AMERICA')  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                                    -> Table scan on region  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                                -> Index lookup on partsupp using PRIMARY (ps_partkey=part.p_partkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                            -> Single-row index lookup on supplier using PRIMARY (s_suppkey=partsupp.ps_suppkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                        -> Filter: (nation.n_regionkey = region.r_regionkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                            -> Single-row index lookup on nation using PRIMARY (n_nationkey=supplier.s_nationkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                    -> Single-row index lookup on supplier using PRIMARY (s_suppkey=partsupp.ps_suppkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                -> Filter: (nation.n_regionkey = region.r_regionkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                    -> Single-row index lookup on nation using PRIMARY (n_nationkey=supplier.s_nationkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)

Warnings:
Note	1276	Field or reference 'test.part.p_partkey' of SELECT #2 was resolved in SELECT #1
