#TPC-H/TPC-R Order Priority Checking Query (Q4)
explain format=tree select
o_orderpriority,
count(*) as order_count
from
orders
where
o_orderdate >=  '1994-09-01'
	and o_orderdate < date_add( '1994-09-01', interval '3' month)
and exists (
select
*
from
lineitem
where
l_orderkey = o_orderkey
and l_commitdate < l_receiptdate
)
group by
o_orderpriority
order by
o_orderpriority;
EXPLAIN
-> Sort: orders.o_orderpriority
    -> Table scan on <temp>
        -> Aggregate using temporary table
            -> Table scan on <temporary>
                -> Aggregate using temporary table
                    -> Remove duplicate orders rows using temporary table (weedout)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Filter: (lineitem.l_commitdate < lineitem.l_receiptdate)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                -> Table scan on lineitem  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Filter: ((orders.o_orderdate >= DATE'1994-09-01') and (orders.o_orderdate < <cache>(('1994-09-01' + interval '3' month))))  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                -> Single-row index lookup on orders using PRIMARY (o_orderkey=lineitem.l_orderkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)

