#TPC-H/TPC-R Small-Quantity-Order Revenue Query (Q17)
explain format=tree select
sum(l_extendedprice) / 7.0 as avg_yearly
from
lineitem,
part
where
p_partkey = l_partkey
and p_brand = 'Brand#33'
	and p_container = 'LG CAN'
	and l_quantity < (
select
0.2 * avg(l_quantity)
from
lineitem
where
l_partkey = p_partkey
);
EXPLAIN
-> Aggregate: sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice)
    -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
        -> Table scan on lineitem  (cost=*** rows=***)
        -> Filter: ((part.p_container = 'LG CAN') and (part.p_brand = 'Brand#33') and (lineitem.l_quantity < (select #2)))  (cost=*** rows=***)
            -> Single-row index lookup on part using PRIMARY (p_partkey=lineitem.l_partkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
            -> Select #2 (subquery in condition; dependent)
                -> Aggregate: avg(lineitem.l_quantity)
                    -> Filter: (lineitem.l_partkey = part.p_partkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Table scan on lineitem  (cost=*** rows=***)

Warnings:
Note	1276	Field or reference 'test.part.p_partkey' of SELECT #2 was resolved in SELECT #1
