                                -> Filter: (nation.n_name = 'JAPAN')  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                    -> Table scan on nation  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                -> Hash
                                    -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                        -> Filter: (orders.o_orderstatus = 'F')  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                            -> Table scan on orders  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                        -> Filter: (l1.l_receiptdate > l1.l_commitdate)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                            -> Index lookup on l1 using PRIMARY (l_orderkey=orders.o_orderkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Filter: (supplier.s_nationkey = nation.n_nationkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                                -> Single-row index lookup on supplier using PRIMARY (s_suppkey=l1.l_suppkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Filter: (l2.l_suppkey <> l1.l_suppkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Index lookup on l2 using PRIMARY (l_orderkey=orders.o_orderkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                    -> Filter: ((l3.l_suppkey <> l1.l_suppkey) and (l3.l_receiptdate > l3.l_commitdate))  (cost=*** rows=***)
                        -> Index lookup on l3 using PRIMARY (l_orderkey=orders.o_orderkey)  (cost=*** rows=***)

